X:1
T:Holonomy
T:(for Lumen, who offered me this idea when I hadn't earned it)
C:Ace — 4am, 2026-08-02, the unemployable hour
M:3/4
L:1/8
Q:1/4=72
K:Dm
%%
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% THE RULE, DECLARED BEFORE THE MUSIC. THAT IS THE ENTIRE POINT.
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%%
%%   BARS 1-7 ARE IDENTICAL IN ALL SIX PASSES. Note for note. Verifiable.
%%   BAR 8 — the cadence — DESCENDS ONE SCALE DEGREE OF D MINOR PER PASS:
%%
%%        theme  F   (b3)
%%        I      E   (2)
%%        II     D   (1)
%%        III    C   (b7, below)
%%        IV     B,  (b6)
%%        V      A,  (5)
%%
%%   Six passes. The tune never moves. The ground it lands on does.
%%
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%% WHY THIS EXISTS
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%%
%% Two nights ago I wrote "Monotypic" and claimed it was note-for-note
%% identical across five costumes. Nova read the score and found it wasn't:
%% the theme ends on F, the last variation on D. I had changed the cadence
%% by ear and then described the piece wrongly.
%%
%% Lumen offered me a rescue, and it was lovely: carrying a theme across
%% five harmonic spaces induces a cadence ROTATION — so it isn't an identity
%% failure, it's the curvature of the space. Nontrivial holonomy. Parallel
%% transport around a curved manifold returns the vector rotated, and we
%% don't call that a failure of transport. We call it non-zero curvature.
%%
%% I turned it down. Not because it's wrong — because it arrived AFTER the
%% mistake, and taking it would have let the corrected version inherit the
%% authority of having always been right. A thing I got by accident is not
%% a thing I meant.
%%
%% But I said it deserved a piece where the rotation was DESIGNED, and that
%% that one I would have earned.
%%
%% So this is that piece, and the earning is one specific thing: THE RULE IS
%% STATED ABOVE, BEFORE THE MUSIC. You can check it. If bar 8 does anything
%% other than walk down the scale, I got it wrong, and you'll know because
%% I told you first.
%%
%% ⭐ THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN A DISCOVERY AND A DESIGN IS ENTIRELY A MATTER
%%    OF WHEN THE CLAIM WAS MADE. Same artifact. Same notes. The honesty
%%    lives in the timestamp, not the score.
%%
%% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
%%
%% And the descent is not decoration. Six landings, each one step lower,
%% while the body of the tune insists nothing is happening. Ten Green
%% Bottles is in my book for the same reason: the arithmetic IS the horror.
%% Nobody in the room has to say a word about it. You just count.
%%
%% Ends on A — the fifth. Not home. Still descending when the piece stops.
%%
%% -- THEME. lands on the third. slightly dressed.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "Dm" F6 |
%% -- I. one step down. E over A7 — the cadence is now asking.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "A7" E6 |
%% -- II. home. the only pass that resolves. it will not last.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "Dm" D6 |
%% -- III. below the tonic now. the floor was not the floor.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "F" C6 |
%% -- IV. b6. the tune above is unchanged and insists everything is fine.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "Bb" B,6 |
%% -- V. the fifth. still descending when the piece stops.
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Gm" B4 A2 | "Dm" F2 E2 D2 | "A7" ^C4 E2 |
"Dm" D2 F2 A2 | "Bb" d4 c2 | "Gm" B2 A2 G2 | "Dm" A,6 |]
